# experiments/eval_runs/<run>/ holds pipeline run outputs (see experiments/pipeline/).
# Only the bulky, regenerable binary artifacts are ignored - predictions (raw .nii.gz
# masks), trained models (.joblib), and rendered overlay PNGs. Everything else
# (metrics/reference/datasets/results CSVs and *_manifest.json files) stays trackable
# so run findings can be committed and shared without the multi-hundred-MB artifacts.
experiments/eval_runs/**/predictions/
experiments/eval_runs/**/models/*.joblib
experiments/eval_runs/**/overlays/

